step	1	2	After starting the quest
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Cassius</col> by the <col=800000>Lumbridge</col> pond wants to know the secrets behind the Groats' famous milk. I should ask <col=800000>Gillie</col> the milkmaid and <col=800000>Seth</col> at the farm what they know.</col>
step	2	6	After giving Cassius the book
line	<str>Cassius by the Lumbridge pond wants to know the secrets behind the Groats' famous milk.</str>
line	<col=000080>I found <col=800000>Seth</col>'s book on his shelf and gave it to <col=800000>Cassius</col>. He gave me a sample of his own milk to try. I should drink the sample and tell him what I think.</col>
step	3	8	After drinking the sample
line	<str>Cassius by the Lumbridge pond wants to know the secrets behind the Groats' famous milk.</str>
line	<str>I found Seth's book on his shelf and gave it to Cassius. He gave me a sample of his own milk to try.</str>
line	<col=000080>The milk sample made me feel rather ill. <col=800000>Cassius</col> gave me a second sample. He wants the <col=800000>Duke of Lumbridge</col> to try it.</col>
step	4	10	After speaking to the Duke
line	<str>Cassius by the Lumbridge pond wants to know the secrets behind the Groats' famous milk.</str>
line	<str>I found Seth's book on his shelf and gave it to Cassius. He gave me a sample of his own milk to try.</str>
line	<str>The milk sample made me feel rather ill. Cassius gave me a second sample.</str>
line	<col=000080>The <col=800000>Duke of Lumbridge</col> wasn't keen on the sample. He suggested I ask <col=800000>Gillie</col> for her opinion.</col>
step	5	12	After speaking to Gillie
line	<str>Cassius by the Lumbridge pond wants to know the secrets behind the Groats' famous milk.</str>
line	<str>I found Seth's book on his shelf and gave it to Cassius. He gave me a sample of his own milk to try.</str>
line	<str>The milk sample made me feel rather ill. Cassius gave me a second sample.</str>
line	<str>The Duke of Lumbridge wasn't keen on the sample.</str>
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Gillie</col> was suspicious of the milk. I should drink the second sample beside her.</col>
step	6	13	After drinking the second sample
line	<str>Cassius by the Lumbridge pond wants to know the secrets behind the Groats' famous milk.</str>
line	<str>I found Seth's book on his shelf and gave it to Cassius. He gave me a sample of his own milk to try.</str>
line	<str>The milk sample made me feel rather ill. Cassius gave me a second sample.</str>
line	<str>The Duke of Lumbridge wasn't keen on the sample.</str>
line	<str>Gillie was suspicious of the milk.</str>
line	<col=000080>I drank the second sample in front of <col=800000>Gillie</col>. She told me an aggressive bull has been penned in the field. I should deal with the bull.</col>
step	7	14	After defeating Brutus
